---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Century Holidays - Booking Agreement"
  description="Review the Terms and Conditions for booking with Century Holidays. Creating memories for every Century. Read our booking agreement and travel policies carefully before planning your journey."
  path="/terms.html"
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <PageHero title="Terms &amp;" highlight="Conditions" subtitle="Last updated: March 2026" />

    <section class="py-20 sm:py-24">
      <div class="container-page">
        <div data-reveal class="prose prose-lg mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-3xl border border-border bg-surface p-10 shadow-panel sm:p-16 prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:text-ink prose-p:text-text-muted prose-li:text-text-muted prose-strong:text-ink">
          <h2>1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By booking a trip, submitting a deposit, or engaging with Century Holidays, you acknowledge that you have
            read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. These terms formulate a crucial
            contract between you and Century Holidays.
          </p>

          <h2>2. Bookings, Deposits &amp; Payments</h2>
          <p>
            To secure your reservation, a non-refundable deposit is required at the time of booking. The specific
            deposit amount will be communicated prior to booking confirmation.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Final payment is globally due 45 days prior to the commencement of travel unless otherwise specified.</li>
            <li>Payments can be made via credit card, debit card, or wire transfer.</li>
            <li>
              Prices quoted are based on current exchange rates and tariffs and are subject to change without notice
              until paid in full.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2>3. Cancellations &amp; Refunds</h2>
          <p>
            If you wish to cancel your booking, you must submit your request to us in writing. Cancellation fees will
            apply based on the date we receive your written notification:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>60+ Days before departure:</strong> Loss of initial deposit.</li>
            <li><strong>59 - 30 Days before departure:</strong> 50% of total booking cost.</li>
            <li><strong>29 - 0 Days before departure:</strong> 100% of total booking cost (no refund).</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>4. Travel Requirements &amp; Passports</h2>
          <p>
            It is exclusively the traveler’s responsibility to ensure they possess valid passports, visas, and
            necessary health documentation (such as vaccination certificates) required for travel. Passports must
            typically be valid for at least six months beyond the completion date of your journey. Century Holidays
            takes no responsibility for travel disruption or loss of funds caused by missing or incorrect travel
            documentation.
          </p>

          <h2>5. Liability &amp; Disclaimers</h2>
          <p>
            Century Holidays acts principally as an agent for airlines, hotels, tour operators, and other third-party
            vendors. We shall not be held liable for any loss, damage, injury, accident, delay, or irregularity which
            may be occasioned by reason of any defect in any vehicle, or through the acts or omissions of any company
            or person engaged in conveying the passenger or carrying out the arrangements of the tour. Additionally,
            we are not liable for incidental disruptions caused by weather, natural disasters, or geopolitical events
            ("Acts of God").
          </p>

          <h2>6. Travel Insurance</h2>
          <p>
            We strongly highly recommend that all travelers purchase comprehensive travel insurance covering trip
            cancellation, medical emergencies, and baggage loss immediately upon booking.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
